      "side": 1,
      "message": "overall, I believe we need to do one of the two things:\n1) go with vbmeta_digest for all checks (see CIL how this CL still relies on AVB doing RSA verification for vbmeta, which we wanted to avoid with vbmeta_digest); or\n2) go with signature verification for vbmeta + kernel digest verification for the prebuilt UUID, no point to complicate the build+sign flow with vbmeta_digest if we don\u0027t rely on it at the AVB vbmeta-verification step",
      "revId": "8bc9df150414137c55cd99c2744ce983f12bde09",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
